DB_DATABASE=/app/db.sqlite3

CACHE_DRIVER=file
QUEUE_CONNECTION=sync

APP_SECRET=your_app_secret_here
</CODE>

### Step 2: Configure the Application

Modify the `bootstrap/app.php` file to enable Eloquent ORM and load the routes.

<FILEPATH>
bootstrap/app.php
</FILEPATH>
